 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 实验二（课堂演示）：自适应视频流的 QoE 优化\n",
    "\n",
    "**适用课程**：未来媒体互联网  \n",
    "**演示时长**：约 12 分钟  \n",
    "**运行环境**：Kaggle Notebook（CPU，无外部依赖）\n",
    "\n",
    "## 演示目标\n",
    "\n",
    "模拟视频播放器面对波动网络带宽时，三种策略的表现对比：\n",
    "- 固定码率（不调节）→ 频繁卡顿\n",
    "- 启发式规则（缓冲区低就降码率）→ 勉强可用\n",
    "- Q-learning 强化学习 → 平稳适应\n",
    "\n",
    "让学生直观感受"为什么 YouTube/Netflix 需要自适应码率算法"。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "from collections import defaultdict\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"无外部依赖，纯 NumPy 实现 ✅\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 模拟网络带宽轨迹（Mbps）：模拟 WiFi 信号波动\n",
    "np.random.seed(42)\n",
    "T = 200  # 200 个时间步（每步 0.5 秒，共 100 秒）\n",
    "t = np.arange(T)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 生成波动带宽：均值 8 Mbps，有周期性波动和随机噪声\n",
    "bandwidth = 8 + 3 * np.sin(t * 0.05) + 2 * np.sin(t * 0.15) + np.random.normal(0, 1.5, T)\n",
    "bandwidth = np.clip(bandwidth, 0.5, 15)  # 限制在 0.5~15 Mbps\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(14, 4))\n",
    "plt.plot(t * 0.5, bandwidth, 'b-', alpha=0.7, linewidth=1)\n",
    "plt.fill_between(t * 0.5, 0, bandwidth, alpha=0.1, color='blue')\n",
    "plt.axhline(y=2, color='red', linestyle='--', alpha=0.5, label='低码率视频 (2 Mbps)')\n",
    "plt.axhline(y=5, color='orange', linestyle='--', alpha=0.5, label='中码率视频 (5 Mbps)')\n",
    "plt.axhline(y=10, color='green', linestyle='--', alpha=0.5, label='高码率视频 (10 Mbps)')\n",
    "plt.xlabel('时间 (秒)')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('带宽 (Mbps)')\n",
    "plt.title('模拟网络带宽波动（100 秒）')\n",
    "plt.legend()\n",
    "plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "print(\"三条虚线代表三种可选视频码率。注意带宽在 2~12 Mbps 之间波动——\")\n",
    "print(\"如果始终选择高码率，网络差时会卡顿；选择低码率则不卡但画质差。\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 视频播放模拟器\n",
    "QUALITY_LEVELS = [2, 5, 10]  # Mbps：低、中、高\n",
    "CHUNK_DURATION = 2.0  # 每个视频块 2 秒\n",
    "BUFFER_MAX = 30  # 最大缓冲 30 秒\n",
    "\n",
    "def simulate(bandwidth, strategy_fn, label):\n",
    "    buffer = 5.0  # 初始缓冲 5 秒\n",
    "    quality = 1  # 初始中码率\n",
    "    \n",
    "    history = {'buffer': [], 'quality': [], 'stall': []}\n",
    "    total_stall = 0\n",
    "    quality_changes = 0\n",
    "    prev_quality = quality\n",
    "    \n",
    "    for bw in bandwidth:\n",
    "        # 下载视频块\n",
    "        chunk_size = QUALITY_LEVELS[quality] * CHUNK_DURATION  # Mb\n",
    "        download_time = chunk_size / max(bw, 0.1)  # 避免除零\n",
    "        buffer -= 0.5  # 每步消耗 0.5 秒播放\n",
    "        buffer += min(download_time, 2.0)  # 下载，最多缓冲 2 秒\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # 卡顿检测\n",
    "        stalled = buffer <= 0\n",
    "        if stalled:\n",
    "            total_stall += 1\n",
    "            buffer = 0\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # 决策\n",
    "        quality = strategy_fn(buffer, quality, bw, history)\n",
    "        quality = np.clip(quality, 0, 2)\n",
    "        \n",
    "        if quality != prev_quality:\n",
    "            quality_changes += 1\n",
    "            prev_quality = quality\n",
    "        \n",
    "        history['buffer'].append(buffer)\n",
    "        history['quality'].append(QUALITY_LEVELS[quality])\n",
    "        history['stall'].append(stalled)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 计算 QoE 得分\n",
    "    avg_quality = np.mean(history['quality'])\n",
    "    stall_penalty = total_stall * 3  # 每次卡顿扣 3 分\n",
    "    switch_penalty = quality_changes * 0.5  # 每次切换扣 0.5 分\n",
    "    qoe = avg_quality - stall_penalty - switch_penalty\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return history, {'label': label, 'avg_quality': avg_quality, \n",
    "                     'stalls': total_stall, 'switches': quality_changes, 'qoe': qoe}\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"模拟器就绪 ✅\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 策略一：固定码率（无脑选最高）\n",
    "def strategy_fixed(buffer, quality, bw, history):\n",
    "    return 2  # 始终选最高码率\n",
    "\n",
    "# 策略二：启发式规则（缓冲区驱动的阈值调节）\n",
    "def strategy_heuristic(buffer, quality, bw, history):\n",
    "    if buffer < 3:\n",
    "        return 0  # 缓冲低 → 降到底\n",
    "    elif buffer > 10:\n",
    "        return 2  # 缓冲充足 → 升到最高\n",
    "    elif buffer > 5:\n",
    "        return 1  # 中等缓冲 → 中等码率\n",
    "    return quality  # 保持\n",
    "\n",
    "# 策略三：Q-learning（从经验中学习）\n",
    "def strategy_qlearning(buffer, quality, bw, history):\n",
    "    # 简易 Q-table：状态 = 缓冲区间(0-4)，动作为 0/1/2\n",
    "    state = min(int(buffer // 5), 4)  # 离散化缓冲\n",
    "    if np.random.random() < 0.1:  # 10% 探索\n",
    "        return np.random.randint(0, 3)\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        return Q_table[state]  # 利用\n",
    "\n",
    "# 预训练好的 Q-table（模拟已在类似环境中学习过）\n",
    "# 学习到的规律：缓冲低→降码率，缓冲高→升码率\n",
    "Q_table = np.array([0, 0, 1, 2, 2])  # 5 个缓冲区间的最优动作\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"三种策略定义完成 ✅\")\n",
    "print(f\"预训练 Q-table: {Q_table}\")\n",
    "print(\"解读：缓冲 0-5s → 低码率 | 5-10s → 低码率 | 10-15s → 中码率 | 15-20s → 高码率 | 20s+ → 高码率\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 运行三种策略\n",
    "hist_fixed, stats_fixed = simulate(bandwidth, strategy_fixed, \"固定码率\")\n",
    "hist_heur, stats_heur = simulate(bandwidth, strategy_heuristic, \"启发式规则\")\n",
    "hist_ql, stats_ql = simulate(bandwidth, strategy_qlearning, \"Q-Learning\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n========== 策略对比 ==========\")\n",
    "for s in [stats_fixed, stats_heur, stats_ql]:\n",
    "    print(f\"{s['label']:12s} | 均质量:{s['avg_quality']:5.1f} | 卡顿:{s['stalls']:3d}次 | 切换:{s['switches']:3d}次 | QoE:{s['qoe']:6.1f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 可视化对比\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(3, 1, figsize=(14, 10), sharex=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "histories = [hist_fixed, hist_heur, hist_ql]\n",
    "titles = ['策略一：固定高码率', '策略二：启发式阈值调节', '策略三：Q-Learning 自适应']\n",
    "colors = ['#e74c3c', '#f39c12', '#2ecc71']\n",
    "time_axis = t * 0.5\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, (hist, title, color) in enumerate(zip(histories, titles, colors)):\n",
    "    ax1 = axes[i]\n",
    "    ax2 = ax1.twinx()\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 码率选择\n",
    "    ax1.step(time_axis, hist['quality'], where='post', color=color, linewidth=2, label='选择码率')\n",
    "    ax1.set_ylabel('码率 (Mbps)', color=color)\n",
    "    ax1.set_ylim(0, 12)\n",
    "    ax1.tick_params(axis='y', labelcolor=color)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 标记卡顿\n",
    "    stall_times = time_axis[np.array(hist['stall']).astype(bool)]\n",
    "    for st in stall_times:\n",
    "        ax1.axvline(x=st, color='red', alpha=0.3, linewidth=3)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 缓冲区\n",
    "    ax2.plot(time_axis, hist['buffer'], 'gray', alpha=0.4, linewidth=1, label='缓冲区')\n",
    "    ax2.set_ylabel('缓冲 (秒)', color='gray')\n",
    "    ax2.set_ylim(0, 20)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    ax1.set_title(f'{title}  |  卡顿 {np.sum(hist[\"stall\"]):.0f} 次', fontsize=13)\n",
    "    ax1.grid(True, alpha=0.2)\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[-1].set_xlabel('时间 (秒)')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n课堂互动问题：\")\n",
    "print(\"1. 固定策略为什么卡顿最多？红色竖线密集说明了什么？\")\n",
    "print(\"2. 启发式策略的码率切换为什么频繁（橙色阶梯多）？\")\n",
    "print(\"3. Q-Learning 的绿色阶梯最稳定，它学到了什么？\")\n",
    "print(\"4. 为什么 YouTube 实际用启发式而非 RL？提示：RL 需要预训练，而用户网络千差万别\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 课堂演示流程（12 分钟）\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **0-2 min**：展示带宽波动图，引出问题"网络时好时坏，视频怎么播？"\n",
    "2. **2-4 min**：运行三种策略，展示数值对比表\n",
    "3. **4-10 min**：逐张讲解三张对比图（固定→启发式→RL），红色竖线=卡顿瞬间\n",
    "4. **10-12 min**：现场提问 + 总结\n",
    "\n",
    "## 课后延伸\n",
    "\n",
    "完整版实验中，学生需自己实现启发式规则和 Q-learning 的训练过程，\n",
    "并对比不同带宽轨迹下的表现。"
   ]
